{"id":"565182669","kind":"article","title":"概念型知识的「最优复习间隔」可能更长","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5fqaiYdbfoGyKF4KU8MV7MFPFe467n2a5LAP"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-09-16","updated":"2022-09-16","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":618,"keywords":["间隔重复","概念性知识","记忆保持","助记媒介","检索提示"],"summary":"译文提出，概念性材料可能比单词或事实等陈述性信息遗忘得慢，因此适合更保守、成本较低的间隔重复安排。作者引用量子国度的早期数据作为线索，但也指出高回忆率可能由提示过多造成，故概念记忆动力学仍需进一步辨析。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/565182669","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"TPxADRaU\">几乎所有关于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5oCe7JTrkYfmb6SHE4n5HxisE7PdwS6nmXEw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔效应</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>应用落地的文献，都只聚焦于陈述型信息，比如单词对、术语定义或简单属性的值。我猜测这是因为概念型信息非常依赖先验知识和背景知识，因此其记忆动力学与陈述型知识截然不同。</p><p data-pid=\"9lucecgM\">针对这类材料，我预计可以使用更保守的复习调度安排，有效降低记忆这类材料的成本，见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5N3g1Tc9jQMmRnExZxY23cUufNS1g6srNAbU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">优化间隔重复系统调度安排</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"u84BSM7T\">用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2fBHADWa93EZTuNzuww7V3Vi587ZyZ4FHTHm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度</a>进行的早期实验显示出比文献中报道的慢得多的遗忘曲线，至少对许多问题是这样：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3WaUVJsHHJEYq2Wt31AVfLjenfqhoahs6XAG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">QCVC 问题最初被遗忘的速度非常不同</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zS5uKLsoTbkJSadTv2U3Z4G3uEBrFxTLy5E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度的用户在实证五天保留后很少遗忘</a> 。这可能部分是因为信息是概念性的、相互联系的，并且是在叙述的背景下引入的（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YjgWTaYfhWLrEbysgmDfFRcZ1yxgLeBeZac\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复卡片通常是原子化的，而助记媒介为其赋予结构</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>）。但另一种解释是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zwzHd1Czz9vhBBFzYrQ91scHALNzZnXsTPj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度的高回忆准确率可能是因为给了过多提示而掩盖了可能的遗忘</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"a1xJSavS\">更多关于间隔重复系统和概念型知识的笔记：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6UZP7P4sRNgRKSvNj7tMV5uW6dDhwwbdZCy9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"tj4hGOOm\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398045447\" href=\"#/post/398045447\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"tK_Q4Oar\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5fqaiYdbfoGyKF4KU8MV7MFPFe467n2a5LAP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Conceptual information may have much slower optimal spaced repetition schedules (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔效应 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"424603970\" href=\"#/post/424603970\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复卡片通常是原子化的，而助记媒介为其赋予结构 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397646854\" href=\"#/post/397646854\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398045447\" href=\"#/post/398045447\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"563891085","title":"通过间隔证明复习来理解证明中的关键点","author":"Issa Rice","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"565467709","title":"间隔重复让你感觉在某门学科上总是学生","author":"Issa Rice","votes":11,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"424603970","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":11,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"397646854","title":"间隔重复卡片通常是原子化的，而助记媒介为其赋予结构","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"398045447","title":"间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"720345834","title":"你应该记住什么？间隔重复你的生活","author":"Jose Luis Ricon","votes":65,"minutes":4,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Jose Luis Ricon"}],"rec_answers":[]}